WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.758
Wakkati ɗuɗɗi, ɓeydi-ɓeydi laawol go'o nder lesdi ndin, mawɗo du'aare fuɗɗii yahugo bee hoore mum nder leɗɗe hirnaange Ouagadougou.

00:00:10.838 --> 00:00:15.557
O waɗi nyalɗe fuu o ɗon ɗaɓɓa, haa o majjina laawol maako.

00:00:15.637 --> 00:00:18.121
Haa saa'i naa'i ɗon wula lesdi.

00:00:18.201 --> 00:00:23.830
Wuttudu maako ɗon maayi diga ɓaawo maajum, koyɗe maako boo ɗon maaya.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:30.035
E wi'aama o ɗaani ley leggal, ngam o anndi o waawataa yi'ugo gariiri maako.

00:00:30.115 --> 00:00:33.924
Ɗo'o waɗi nde coccorgal wurti nder leɗɗe mawɗe.

00:00:34.004 --> 00:00:38.308
Mawɗo yi'aago, ngam o ɓeydaayi, o maɓɓiti gite maako.

00:00:38.388 --> 00:00:40.542
Ammaa dabbaajo on haɓɓi mo.

00:00:40.622 --> 00:00:45.672
Sey Yeesu ƴiwoyi yeeso, darii, wayliti, wi'i mo o tokki maako.

00:00:45.752 --> 00:00:51.546
Sey o wurti, o tokki mo, o yahi to ndiyam ɓii-ɓiiɗi, o ɓoydi dow leɗɗe.

00:00:51.626 --> 00:00:54.855
O njari, o nyaami, o ɓeydi semmbe maako.

00:00:54.935 --> 00:00:58.082
Nde o wari, o wi'i yimɓe maako ko waɗi.

00:00:58.162 --> 00:01:05.859
E nder nyalnde nde'e, ɓe mbi'i alkawal waɗii: Yimɓe Saboo'en mbaawaa waɗugo ko wooɗaa kooɗume.

00:01:05.939 --> 00:01:09.416
Yimɓe Sababu boo mbaawataa waɗuki ko wooɗi.

00:01:09.496 --> 00:01:14.132
Haa jooni, kookooɓe nder ladde Sabou ina ndaaretee masin.

00:01:14.212 --> 00:01:23.646
Yimɓe gariiri ɗon njooɗdi bee maɓɓe, ɓe ɗon hulɓina ɓe, nden ɓe mbi'i to crocodile maayi, ɓe teddina mo bana neɗɗo.

00:01:23.726 --> 00:01:30.348
Yimɓe ɗon njaha haa maɓɓe, ɓe ɗon yahda bee ardiiɓe gariiri ɓe anndi laabi maɓɓe.

00:01:30.428 --> 00:01:41.351
To mawɓe mbi'i suka'en haala nde'e, ɓe timmi bee haala go'o: Goonga naa' seɗɗa, nden kam faamuki Allah waaway ɓeydaago nyalnde neɗɗo.
